<view class="page couple-page">
  <view class="couple-heading"><view><text class="eyebrow">BETWEEN US</text><text class="display-title">我们</text></view><button class="mail-button press" bindtap="messages">信笺<text wx:if="{{unread}}">{{unread}}</text></button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{couple.status === 'UNPAIRED'}}" class="unpaired-card">
    <view class="two-orbits"><view></view><view></view><text>＋</text></view><text class="unpaired-title">先把自己的日子记下来，&#10;也可以邀请 TA 一起。</text><text class="unpaired-note">配对后，只有你主动设为“共同可见”的记录才会出现在这里。旧记录不会自动共享。</text><button class="primary-button press" bindtap="invite">邀请另一半</button><button class="secondary-button press" bindtap="privacy">先了解共享规则</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{couple.status === 'ENDED'}}" class="ended-card card"><text class="ended-mark">⌁</text><text class="section-title">情侣空间已停止访问</text><text class="section-note">你仍可在“时光”中查看自己创建的记录。对方上传的内容和原情侣回顾已隐藏。</text><button class="secondary-button press" bindtap="privacy">查看隐私设置</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="relation-card">
      <view class="relation-art"><view class="avatar mine">满</view><view class="thread"></view><view class="avatar partner">屿</view></view>
      <text class="relation-kicker">{{couple.relationshipName}}</text><text class="relation-days">{{days}}</text><text class="relation-unit">一起生活的日子</text><view class="anniversary"><text>纪念日</text><text>{{couple.anniversary}}</text></view>
    </view>
    <view class="quick-grid"><button class="quick-card press" bindtap="messages"><text>02</text><text class="label">新的信笺</text><text class="small">回应与短评</text></button><button class="quick-card press"><text>03</text><text class="label">共同片段</text><text class="small">已共享记录</text></button></view>
    <button class="pet-card press" bindtap="pet"><view class="pet-scene"><view class="pet-body"><view class="decor"></view><view class="decor"></view><text>⌁</text></view><view class="pet-shadow"></view></view><view class="pet-copy"><text class="eyebrow">OUR LITTLE CLOUD</text><text class="pet-name">{{pet.name}} · Lv.{{pet.level}}</text><text class="label">{{pet.kind}}今天在等你们</text><view class="growth-track"><view class="decor" style="width: {{pet.growth}}%"></view></view><text class="small">成长值 {{pet.growth}} / 100</text></view><text class="pet-arrow">›</text></button>
    <view class="memory-prompt"><text>今日轻任务</text><text class="label">记录一件让你想起 TA 的小事</text><button bindtap="messages">稍后看看</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
